/** @dir Lib/MakeASound/Devices
    Audio devices and streams (namespace MakeASound), included through
    MakeASound.h.

    - DeviceManager enumerates devices on every backend miniaudio offers and
      runs at most one stream. Its errors come back as values, never thrown.
    - The stream callback runs on an OS audio thread: no allocation, locks or
      logging there.
    - Engine runs a Processor on that stream with MidiManager's queued inputs
      feeding its MIDI bus.
    - DeviceQueries answers questions about a device that need no open stream.
      AudioSession is the iOS audio session and does nothing elsewhere.
*/
